---
import StudioLayout from '../../../layouts/StudioLayout.astro';
import { studioSnapshot as s } from '../../../data/studio';
export function getStaticPaths(){ return [{ params:{ id:s.campaign.slug } }]; }
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<StudioLayout title={`${s.campaign.title} · Campaign Room`} eyebrow="CAMPAIGN ROOM">
  <Fragment slot="heading"><h1>{s.campaign.title}</h1></Fragment>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-grid two">
    <article class="studio-card"><div class="meta-line"><span class="studio-chip">{s.campaign.id}</span><span class="studio-chip">{s.campaign.module}</span><span class="studio-chip warn">{s.campaign.nextGate}</span></div><h2>为什么现在</h2><p>{s.campaign.symptom}</p><h3>目标用户</h3><p>{s.campaign.user}</p><h3>核心主张</h3><p>{s.campaign.coreClaim}</p></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><p class="eyebrow">Gate Stack</p><table class="studio-table"><tbody><tr><td>Evidence</td><td>{s.campaign.nextGate}</td></tr><tr><td>Production</td><td>{s.campaign.productionState}</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td>{s.campaign.actionStatus}</td></tr><tr><td>Outcome</td><td>{s.campaign.outcomeStatus}</td></tr><tr><td>Changed Rule</td><td>{s.campaign.changedRuleStatus}</td></tr></tbody></table></article>
  </div></section>
  <section class="studio-section"><div class="container studio-grid three">
    <article class="studio-card"><h3>Evidence</h3><p>Brain #2仍需完成3个一手来源、反例与冲突协议。</p><a class="studio-link" href="https://github.com/moonstachain/yuanli-brain/issues/2">推进证据 →</a></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><h3>Works</h3><p>现有Hook / Mechanism / Action只作为Web公开产物指针，不在Studio复制正文。</p><a class="studio-link" href={`${base}/campaigns/ai-distillation/`}>查看C端战役 →</a></article>
    <article class="studio-card"><h3>Outcome</h3><p>目标是10名真实用户完成AI清算，并产生可观察行动；当前NOT_RUN。</p><a class="studio-link" href="https://github.com/moonstachain/yuanli-content-engine-os/issues/35">推进Campaign →</a></article>
  </div></section>
</StudioLayout>
